# Receipt Vault Privacy Policy

**Last updated: 11 September 2026**

## 1. Introduction

Receipt Vault ("the App") is a personal receipt and warranty management application.

This Privacy Policy explains how Receipt Vault handles information entered or stored by you when you use the App.

Receipt Vault is designed with a **local-first approach**. Your purchase information, warranty information, notes and receipt files are stored locally on your device and are not uploaded to a Receipt Vault server.

